Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.83,0:00:03.64,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, she's such a battler.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她真是顽强的斗士
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.64,0:00:06.23,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And that is another tough service game.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N又艰难地守住一个发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.31,0:00:09.47,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}北京时间{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}27{\fs68}号晚间 广州首轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.47,0:00:12.30,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fs78}46{\fs68}岁的大威两个{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}出局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.30,0:00:14.03,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}单打{\fs78}16{\fs68}连败
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.03,0:00:16.99,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}可这一场 她也有过抵抗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.31,0:00:21.38,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}首局救回{\fs78}0{\fs68}比{\fs78}40{\fs68} 还是失守
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.38,0:00:24.48,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fs78}18{\fs68}岁的塔格尔先占上风
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.06,0:00:26.49,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, that is a beauty.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这球真漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.10,0:00:30.06,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Trading backhands, but Tagger had the final say.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N反拍对峙 塔格尔笑到最后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.26,0:00:31.88,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}上一次单打赢球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.88,0:00:34.13,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}还是去年{\fs78}7{\fs68}月的华盛顿
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.13,0:00:36.70,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}此后{\fs78}15{\fs68}个月 跨过两个赛季
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.70,0:00:39.02,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}连败已经来到{\fs78}16{\fs68}场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.26,0:00:42.43,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}塔格尔用单手反拍抢攻
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.43,0:00:44.48,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}把大威压在底线
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.61,0:00:45.56,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And she does.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她做到了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.61,0:00:48.61,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The backhand is looking very, very good.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这记反拍打得非常漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.06,0:00:50.66,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}塔格尔不断抢攻
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.66,0:00:53.76,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}首盘两次破掉大威的发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.51,0:00:57.16,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Yeah, that sat up nicely.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这球弹起的位置正合适
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.71,0:00:58.66,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Tagger knew what to do.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N塔格尔清楚该怎么处理
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.96,0:01:02.34,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68} 大威又被逼到破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.76,0:01:06.26,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, that is just beautifully guided.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这球的落点控制得太漂亮了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.11,0:01:09.36,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And there's nothing Venus Williams could do about that.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N大威对这一球也无能为力
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.06,0:01:13.92,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}落后 这一盘的退路越来越窄
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.36,0:01:21.71,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It does feel now a long way back for Venus Williams in this opening set.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N大威这一盘想追上来 已经很难
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.91,0:01:25.56,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}对手的发球局 她仍然找不到突破口
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.80,0:01:28.16,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, what an angle.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这个角度真刁钻
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.40,0:01:30.56,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And seals it in style.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她漂亮地拿下这一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.81,0:01:32.26,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Hat-trick of aces.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N三记发球直接得分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.91,0:01:35.76,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A tremendous opening set there by Lilli Tagger.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N塔格尔首盘表现相当出色
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.11,0:01:41.51,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And she takes it six games to two.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她六比二赢下首盘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.26,0:01:46.36,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And you see thirty-four minutes on the clock.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N首盘用时三十四分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.51,0:01:49.51,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}第二盘 开局依然是被动
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.81,0:01:55.61,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And she will not want a repeat of set one.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N大威不想重演第一盘的局面
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.76,0:01:57.40,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}塔格尔的接发很深
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.40,0:02:00.05,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}大威很难先发起进攻
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.46,0:02:07.66,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A little lucky. You see the hands going up from Tagger there.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N有一点幸运 塔格尔举手示意
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.91,0:02:09.61,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}单打的胜利还没等来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.61,0:02:11.84,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}发球局的危机又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.11,0:02:14.41,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Just too good.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这球确实出色
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.41,0:02:18.51,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The length that Tagger's finding, particularly on the return.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N塔格尔的落点很深 尤其是接发球
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.71,0:02:22.19,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}第二盘第一个发球局 还是没能守住
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.26,0:02:23.56,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And she has.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她拿下了这一局
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.66,0:02:28.46,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Four games in a row then for Lilli Tagger.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N塔格尔已经连赢四局
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.56,0:02:30.99,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fs78}0{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}后 大威还在追
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.99,0:02:34.39,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}全场{\fs78}16{\fs68}个破发点 她救下{\fs78}12{\fs68}个
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.39,0:02:36.12,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}一次次被逼到边缘
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.12,0:02:38.28,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}她还在把比赛往回拉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.71,0:02:44.81,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, and then it's always the way, isn't it? Always the way.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N唉 偏偏又是这样的结果
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.16,0:02:47.21,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}从{\fs78}0{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}追回一局
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.21,0:02:48.29,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}落后
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.29,0:02:50.89,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}她还在努力把比分拉回来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.16,0:02:55.58,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}后 这个发球局又被拉进苦战
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.58,0:02:58.81,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}大威把这一分拿下来 追到{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.96,0:03:02.86,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, she's such a battler.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她真是顽强的斗士
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.91,0:03:05.26,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And that is another tough service game.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N又艰难地守住一个发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.91,0:03:07.26,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Tagger picked her off.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一次 塔格尔抓住了机会
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.46,0:03:08.84,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}可守住一局之后
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.84,0:03:11.04,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}她始终没拿到破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.04,0:03:13.53,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}时 危机没能再化解
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.53,0:03:15.98,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}对手迎来发球胜赛局
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.97,0:03:19.87,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Match points then for Tagger.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N塔格尔迎来连续赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.37,0:03:24.02,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And seals it in style. Ace number six.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N漂亮收官 第六记发球直接得分
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.37,0:03:29.92,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And it is a tremendous win for Lilli Tagger against Venus Williams.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N塔格尔击败大威 漂亮地赢球
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.07,0:03:33.62,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}这一次 她又没能等来单打的胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.97,0:03:37.57,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Barely put a foot wrong in the whole match, the Austrian.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这位奥地利姑娘 全场发挥相当稳健
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.67,0:03:44.97,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Takes the applause. It's another wonderful win in a wonderful season.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N接受掌声 出色赛季再添胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.07,0:03:47.33,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}制胜分 {\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}29{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.33,0:03:50.77,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}对手一发进球的{\fs78}25{\fs68}分 全部拿下
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.77,0:03:52.45,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}抵抗没能变成反攻
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.45,0:03:54.96,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}这就是比分背后的差距
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.07,0:03:58.80,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fs78}16{\fs68}连败 指的是单打
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.80,0:04:01.33,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}就在昨天 大威搭档曾丽美
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.33,0:04:04.64,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68} {\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}赢下双打首轮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.64,0:04:07.76,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}她的广州之旅 还在继续
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.07,0:04:12.26,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}下一场 去双打赛场继续看她
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.26,0:04:13.82,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}也愿下一次单打
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.82,0:04:15.84,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}等来一场久违的胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.84,0:04:18.12,TL,,0,0,307,,{\an2}你还会为她加油吗？
